. Minh,</span></span><br><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">"Improving the feature set in IoT intrusion detection problem based on FP-Growth algorithm," in </span><i><span style="line-height:130%;">Proc. 2020 Int. Conf. Adv. Technol. Commun. (ATC)</span></i><span style="line-height:130%;">, 2020, DOI: 10.1109/ATC50776.2020.9255431.</span></span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">L. T. H. Van, P. V. Huong, T. Q. Hoa, L. D. Thuan, and N. H. Minh,</span></span><br><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">"Feature generation by K-means for convolutional neural network in detecting IoT system attacks," in </span><i><span style="line-height:130%;">Proc. 2021 IEEE Int. Conf. Mach. Learn. Appl. Netw. Technol. (ICMLANT)</span></i><span style="line-height:130%;">, El Salvador, Dec. 2021, pp. 325–341, DOI: 10.1109/ICMLANT53170.2021.9690532.</span></span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">L. T. H. Van, L. D. Thuan, P. V. Huong, and N. H. Minh,</span></span><br><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">"A new method to improve the CNN configuration for IoT attack detection problem based on the genetic algorithm and multi-objective approach," in </span><i><span style="line-height:130%;">Proc. 2024 1st IEEE Int. Conf. Cryptogr. Inf. Secur. (VCRIS)</span></i><span style="line-height:130%;">, Hanoi, Vietnam, Dec. 2024, DOI: 10.1109/VCRIS63677.2024.10813441.</span></span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">L. T. H. Van, P. V. Huong, and H. M. Nguyen,</span></span><br><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">"The multi-objective optimization of the convolutional neural network for the problem of IoT system attack detection," in </span><i><span style="line-height:130%;">Modelling, Computation and Optimization in Information Systems and Management Sciences (MCO 2021)</span></i><span style="line-height:130%;">, Lecture Notes in Networks and Systems, vol. 350–360, Springer, 2021, DOI: 10.1007/978-3-030-92666-3_30.</span></span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">L. T. H. Van, P. V. Huong, and N. H. Minh,</span></span><br><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">"The multi-objective optimization of the convolutional neural network for the problem of IoT system attack detection," in </span><i><span style="line-height:130%;">Modelling, Computation and Optimization in Information Systems and Management Sciences (MCO 2021)</span></i><span style="line-height:130%;">, Lecture Notes in Networks and Systems, vol. 363, pp. 350–360, Springer, 2021.</span></span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">L. T. H. Van, L. D. Thuan, P. V. Huong, and N. H. Minh,</span></span><br><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">"A new method to improve the CNN configuration for IoT attack detection problem based on the genetic algorithm and multi-objective approach," in </span><i><span style="line-height:130%;">Proc. 2024 1st IEEE Int. Conf. Cryptogr. Inf. Secur. (VCRIS)</span></i><span style="line-height:130%;">, Hanoi, Vietnam, Dec. 2024, DOI: 10.1109/VCRIS63677.2024.10813441.</span></span></p></li><li><p style="text-align:justify;"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">L. T. H. Van, N. Q. Minh, P. V. Huong, and N. H. Minh,</span></span><br><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:14.0pt;"><span style="line-height:130%;">"A novel approach for 1D CNN hyperparameter optimization in IoT attack detection using PSO," </span><i><span style="line-height:130%;">J. Inf. Secur. (ISJ)</span></i><span style="line-height:130%;">, to be published, 2025.</span></span></p></li></ol>
